## Build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/

## Tests — never needed in the runtime image
tests/

## IDE / OS
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
.DS_Store

## Git (this repo currently has none, kept for when it does)
.git/
.gitignore

## Secrets & local config — never bake these into an image layer
.env
.env.*
appsettings.*.local.json
secrets.json

## Logs
**/logs/
**/*.log

## Docs / misc — irrelevant to the build, just bloats the context
*.docx
README.md
